{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o003b","title":"韩浩勒兵定众拒绝因质受胁斩劫者","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o003b-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"韩浩勒兵定众拒绝因质受胁斩劫者","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o003b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0128","role":"定军救质","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o003b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0027","role":"获救","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o003b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"吕布入濮阳时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o003b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-o003b-q","source_order":[9,4,"O003b"],"order":2106}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0027","name":"夏侯惇","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0128","name":"韩浩","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o003b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-7216c9410c1e7f3c13c6","layer":"original","quote":"惇将韩浩，乃勒兵屯惇营门，召军吏诸将：皆案甲当部不得动〖4〗。诸营乃定。遂诣惇所，叱持质者曰：“汝等凶逆，乃敢执劫大将（军）！复欲望生邪？且吾受命讨贼，宁能以一将军之故〖5〗，而纵汝乎！”因涕泣谓惇曰：“当奈国法何〖6〗！”促召兵击持质者。持质者惶遽叩头，言：“我但欲乞资用去耳〖7〗！”浩数责〖8〗，皆斩之。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":40,"end":195}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
